    "description": "Objective\n\nStamp the Agency Sign Up Date on a Player the first time a Sign-Up is created for them, and never move it afterwards.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Automation populates Player.Agency Sign Up Date when the FIRST Sign-Up record is created for that Player\n\n* Value must not be changed by any subsequent automation once set\n\n* Manual admin correction remains possible\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* First Sign-Up sets the date\n\n* Second and subsequent Sign-Ups leave it untouched\n\nDependencies\n\nBUILD-12 (field — complete).\n\nEstimate: S · \\~3h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 4.",
